#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
MiniCut Patch 25: MEDIA PREVIEW + EASE CURVE + TOOLBAR LABELS + SETTINGS UI + NODE COLORS + FULL-FPS
=====================================================================================================

1. Media Pool preview  - hidden when nothing selected; draggable seek bar; "Preview" badge.
2. EaseEditor ball     - binary-search Bezier solver + delta-time: smooth animation.
3. Toolbar labels      - hidden by default, shown on hover or when the tool is active.
4. Settings dialog     - reorganised into Section cards; window 560 px wide.
5. Node category colors- configurable per-category colours in Appearance tab.
6. Full-FPS UI timers  - animation timers sync to the monitor refresh rate.

    python apply_25_preview_ease_toolbar_settings_nodefps.py            install
    python apply_25_preview_ease_toolbar_settings_nodefps.py --check    preview only
    python apply_25_preview_ease_toolbar_settings_nodefps.py --revert   undo last install
    python apply_25_preview_ease_toolbar_settings_nodefps.py --force    install over local edits
"""
